.
.  Generate sample output for Xbar control chart
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na xbarplot.ps
device 2 postscript
.
SKIP 25
READ CROARK3.DAT Y X
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL DAY
CHARACTER CONTROL CHART
LINE CONTROL CHART
.
XBAR CHART Y X
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp XBARPLOT.PS xbarplot.ps
system rm XBARPLOT.PS
.
quit
